{"id":"aff8f37a218f090dd2068ef9a77c80af2bd4053b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234059","title":"本次重置完 20X 的 pro 额度只有平时的 10 分之一了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"john46","excerpt":"OpenAI - @john46 - 之前有稳定 3000M 左右，现在只有 250M 左右啊，额度咔咔掉，怎么回事啊？？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>之前有稳定 3000M 左右，现在只有 250M 左右啊，额度咔咔掉，怎么回事啊？？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/额度\"><li></li> 额度</a><a href=\"/tag/下降\"><li></li> 下降</a><a href=\"/tag/问题\"><li></li> 问题</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-14 10:42:41 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969725\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f59b786fd9cd2ec2b95720531ebbe83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Y25tIGxpdmlk\" data-uid=\"623288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 12:16:25 +08:00\">22h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>正价吗？单人使用吗？没有啥合租或者共享行为吧。</p><p>如果是的话，那可以确定是 oai 又 TM 出 bug 了</p><p>如果有其他疑似违规行为的话，还有可能是 oai 什么风控啥的。</p><p>最近这几天，基本都在喊额度爆减。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969778\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d162/e079/472520_normal.png?m=1780077821\" alt=\"john46\" data-uid=\"472520\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/john46\">john46</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 12:32:28 +08:00\">22h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a> 在国外服务器 sub2api 搭的中转站服务，这个方案之前用了好久了，这个号这一个月都正常有 3B 周额度，这三天是过期的最后三天，今天重置之前就不正常了，只有 1.5B ，重置完更是只剩下 250M</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969804\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f59b786fd9cd2ec2b95720531ebbe83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Y25tIGxpdmlk\" data-uid=\"623288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 12:43:57 +08:00\">22h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/john46\">john46</a> #2 昨天听说是把 sub2api 更新到最新 175 版本，就显示正常了，你试试看。</p><p>不过我感觉可能是 oai 的又一次 bug ，要么就是风控了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969832\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2764/b409/36672_normal.png?m=1734657235\" alt=\"keniusahdu\" data-uid=\"36672\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/keniusahdu\">keniusahdu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 12:59:15 +08:00\">21h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也遇到了。就是 sub2api 的 175 版本，感觉就是 OpenAI 的问题。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17969944\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f891/f3a2/61965_normal.png?m=1412762678\" alt=\"0987363\" data-uid=\"61965\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/0987363\">0987363</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 13:36:06 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>好像是又出问题了，我的 5x 也是，codex 用的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970019\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 13:49:48 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>怎么查出来的呀</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970091\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d162/e079/472520_normal.png?m=1780077821\" alt=\"john46\" data-uid=\"472520\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/john46\">john46</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 14:00:36 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a> 一直都是 175 ，刚刚更新了 176 依然是这个咔咔速度，观察了一下缓存命中率只有 80 多，之前都是 94 左右的，不知道跟这个有没有关系。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970147\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0d45b7a7ca9de80b6e33af28ffd98ec6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"liansishen\" data-uid=\"575025\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liansishen\">liansishen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 14:09:09 +08:00\">20h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就是 oai 风控了，这次风控有好多都是 outlook 邮箱账号，gmail 账号几乎没有被风控的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970799\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/879e/7e00/496618_normal.png?m=1786610342\" alt=\"yihy8023\" data-uid=\"496618\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yihy8023\">yihy8023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 15:40:18 +08:00\">19h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>换成重新在 cpa 登录试试，感觉是 sub2api 的问题。上轮重置把认证从 sub2api 导入到了 cpa ，额度没有明显变化。今天的重置，我把两个 plus 账号重新在 cpa 登录了，额度感觉正常了。</p><p> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/m6WKu8d.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m6WKu8d.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17970949\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/729c/6ca2/405139_normal.png?m=1772348500\" alt=\"IanHo\" data-uid=\"405139\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/IanHo\">IanHo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:02:50 +08:00\">18h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那估计又要重置了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971087\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1784387864\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:21:19 +08:00\">18h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>奥特曼真行啊，这么点计费都搞不明白</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17971097\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/30de/9ece/7940_normal.png?m=1784118256\" alt=\"fcten\" data-uid=\"7940\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fcten\">fcten</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-13 16:22:12 +08:00\">18h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>被风控了，是不是多人共享账号了。我只用 Codex App 和 CLI 目前一切正常。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17973562\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\